		description=Adds `/js/tts.js` to the `APP_SHELL` array precached on install.
		build=One line inside `APP_SHELL`.
		evidence=`caches.open(CACHE_VERSION).then(cache => cache.addAll(APP_SHELL))` (install handler) then includes this path.
