	n7_5: 7.5 Dispatch a page-side media action to the controller <leaf>
		why=Each of the five media actions a headset key can send needs to reach the one controller method that already implements it, without a second play/pause/stop state machine.
		description=Maps `'play'` to `start(cursor)` (only while not already playing), `'pause'` to `pause()` (only while playing), `'stop'` to `stop()`, `'next'` to `nextSentence()` (4.6), and `'prev'` to `prevSentence()` (4.6).
		build=`window.__codexaTtsMedia = (action) => {...}` is set once inside `createTts` (4) and reused by every call from `sendTtsMedia` (7.4).
